Package: totaljs-dns
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: dnsmasq-base, systemd-resolved
Homepage: https://www.totaljs.com
Description: The local domain of the Total.js Developer Distros
 Makes totaljs.developer and every name under it (code.totaljs.developer,
 pgadmin.totaljs.developer, the address of each project...) point to this
 computer, so that the reverse proxy of the services can tell them apart. A small
 dnsmasq answers only that domain, on its own loopback address (127.0.0.100),
 and systemd-resolved sends to it the names of the domain and nothing else, so the
 rest of the DNS of the system is not touched.
